    'See this as a table': '以表格查看', 'Rows the class found hardest': '全班觉得最难的列', 'How each row was scored': '每一列的评分情形', 'How many papers got each score on each row, in the rubric’s order. A half point counts with the whole number below it. The stronger the blue, the higher the score.': '每一列每个分数各有多少份作业,依评分标准的顺序。半分算入下面的整数。蓝色越深,分数越高。',
    'Who’s missing or unfinished': '谁缺交或未完成', 'A grade on the paper to confirm': '要确认的作业上成绩', 'Scores in the order you gave them. The same scores are in the list under the chart.': '依你给分的顺序排列的分数。同样的分数也在图表下方的清单中。', 'Did you get harder or softer as you went?': '你是否越改越严或越改越松?',
    'Too few papers to say.': '作业太少,无法判断。', 'First scored': '最先评分', 'Last scored': '最后评分', 'Rubric rows aren’t read one by one with fewer than 20 papers: each row is too noisy on its own.': '作业少于 20 份时,不会逐列分析评分标准:单看一列的变动太大。', 'This goes by when each score last changed, so a paper you came back to counts as late. Finished scores only.': '这是依每个分数最后一次更改的时间,所以你回头改的作业会算作较晚。只计已完成的分数。',
    'See these as a list': '以清单查看', 'The same score, side by side': '同样的分数,并排', 'No two papers share a finished score yet.': '还没有两份作业的完成分数相同。', 'Other ways to give work back': '发回作业的其他方式', 'Return marked files': '发回批改文件', '(you can still download)': '(仍然可以下载)',
    'Download ZIP': '下载 ZIP', 'or': '', 'save into a folder…': '存到文件夹…', 'Options:': '选项:', 'student folders, grade sheet, marks stay editable, mark key': '学生文件夹、成绩单、批注可编辑、符号图例', 'Your original files don’t change. A file you marked anywhere goes back whole, every page in order. Word rubrics you scored go back as Word files. Files with no marks stay out. Comments go in a right-hand margin.': '你的源文件案不会改变。在任何地方有批注的文件会整份发回,所有页面依序。你评过分的 Word 评分标准会以 Word 文件发回。没有批注的文件不包含在内。评语放在右侧边栏。',
    'Anchor papers': '基准作业', 'Pick a high, middle and low paper while you mark: under the score, click High, Mid or Low.': '批改时选出高、中、低作业:在分数下方点击高、中或低。', 'Not picked yet': '还没选', 'One student at a time': '一次一位学生', 'Give one student their marked paper now, without waiting for the rest.': '不用等其他人,现在就把批改好的作业发回给一位学生。',
    'Papers with names covered': '遮住姓名的作业', 'A ZIP of every page as a picture': '每一页存成图片的 ZIP', 'Check the covers': '检查遮盖', 'Marks only': '只有批注', 'One file: scores, rubric and your marks': '一个文件:分数、评分标准和你的批注', 'Make the file': '制作文件', 'Paste a reply, and it goes to each student': '粘贴回复,它会分给每位学生',
    'Paste a reply': '粘贴回复', 'Remove row': '删除这一列', 'How do you score this one?': '这份要怎么评分?', 'Just the total': '只有总分', 'Grading right on your own rubric? Use Just the total: one score box, and the Grades tab and percents still work.': '直接在自己的评分标准上评分?使用“只有总分”:一个分数栏,成绩标签页和百分比仍然可用。',
    'Rubric bank': '评分标准库', 'Save this rubric to the bank to use it again. It keeps the rows, what each score means and the grading scale, sorted by unit. Rubrics in the Planner’s sidebar shows the same bank.': '把这份评分标准存到库中以便再用。它保留各列、每个分数的意思和评分等级,依单元排序。备课侧栏中的评分标准显示同一个库。',
    'Save to the bank…': '存到库中…', 'What each score means': '每个分数的意思', '+ Add a row': '+ 添加一列', 'Each row is scored 0 to': '每一列的分数从 0 到', 'Half points': '半分', 'Tag rows with learning goals…': '把列链接到学习目标…', 'Optional: see each class and student by goal.': '选填:依目标查看每个班级和学生。',
    'Grading scale': '评分等级', 'No scale': '没有等级', 'Save this scale…': '保存这个等级…', 'Leave a row blank if you never use it. Half points land between two rows.': '从不使用的列可以留空。半分会落在两列之间。', 'Your rubric, for every student': '你的评分标准,给每位学生', 'Bring in your rubric once and every student gets their own copy to grade on. A Word rubric (.docx or .docm) stays a Word file: type in it, check its boxes and shade its cells. A PDF or picture is added as a page you can mark up. Each copy goes back with that student’s work.': '导入评分标准一次,每位学生都会得到自己的一份来评分。Word 评分标准(.docx 或 .docm)会保持为 Word 文件:可以在里面打字、勾选方框和填色单元格。PDF 或图片会加为一页可批注的页面。每一份都会和该学生的作业一起发回。',
    'Bring in my rubric…': '导入我的评分标准…', 'Scores you already gave stay put if you rename rows.': '重命名列时,已给的分数不会变。', 'Tag this score with learning goals…': '把这个分数链接到学习目标…', 'Show everyone': '显示所有人', 'Folder order': '文件夹顺序', 'Partial: some rows scored': '部分:有些列已评分',
    'Marked missing': '已标记缺交', 'Read from the paper, not on this scale': '从作业读取,不在这个等级上', 'Your score is above the total or below 0': '你的分数高于总分或低于 0', 'Left out of the average by you': '你已排除在平均之外', 'Late, and counted': '迟交,并计入', 'Everyone has a finished score or a mark saying why not.': '每个人都有完成的分数,或有说明原因的标记。',
