    '(paper)': '(作业)', 'Status': '状态', 'No finished scores yet, so there’s nothing to chart.': '还没有完成的分数,所以没有可以画成图表的内容。', 'No rubric rows scored yet.': '还没有已评分的评分标准列。', 'Next without feedback': '下一位未给反馈', 'Opens the next student whose feedback isn’t complete (Enter, or N)': '打开下一位反馈未完成的学生 (Enter 或 N)',
    'Next': '下一位', 'See what every score means on this row': '查看这一列每个分数的意思', 'Point at a score to see what it means.': '指向一个分数即可看到它的意思。', 'Less': '收起', 'Nothing written for this row yet. Edit rubric adds it.': '这一列还没有写任何内容。用“编辑评分标准”加入。',
    'Click a name to go there.': '点姓名即可前往。', 'Scores not finished': '分数未完成', 'No paper': '没有作业', 'Scores that disagree with the paper': '与作业不一致的分数', 'Files with no marks': '没有批注的文件', 'Grades to confirm': '待确认的成绩', 'it couldn’t be opened, so it won’t be in the export': '无法打开,所以不会包含在导出中',
    'Keep student folders': '保留学生文件夹', 'One PDF for each student': '每位学生一个 PDF', 'All their papers in one file, the feedback page first. Word papers become pages too. A Word rubric you scored still goes as a Word file.': '把该学生的所有作业放在一个文件中,反馈页在最前面。Word 作业也会变成页面。你评过分的 Word 评分标准仍以 Word 文件发回。',
    'Name each file by student and assignment': '每个文件依学生和作业命名', 'Files keep the names they were turned in with.': '文件保留缴交时的名称。', 'Add the grade sheet (a crop of each typed grade, in folder order)': '加入成绩单(每个手写成绩的裁切图,依文件夹顺序)', 'Keep marks editable': '保持批注可编辑',
    'Bring a file back in later and change its marks. Files are about twice as big.': '之后可以重新导入文件并修改批注。文件大约会变成两倍大。', 'Add a key to the marks used on each paper': '在每份作业加上所用符号的图例', 'No file has proofreading marks yet.': '还没有文件有校对符号。', 'Change what they mean…': '更改它们的意思…',
