    'feedback page': '反馈页', 'files with no marks too': '也包含没有批注的文件', 'extra sharp': '超清晰', 'Your original files don’t change. A file you marked anywhere goes back whole, every page in order. Word rubrics you scored go back as Word files. Files with no marks go too. Comments go in a right-hand margin.': '你的源文件案不会改变。在任何地方有批注的文件会整份发回,所有页面依序。你评过分的 Word 评分标准会以 Word 文件发回。没有批注的文件也会一起发回。评语放在右侧边栏。',
    '✓ All clear: everyone is scored, scores match the papers, and every file is marked.': '✓ 一切就绪:每个人都有分数,分数与作业一致,每个文件都有批注。',
    /* boxes opened from a class page: an assignment, a roster, a unit, how the class is graded, the wording boxes, notes pages and progress sheets */
    'New assignment': '添加作业', 'Edit assignment': '编辑作业', 'e.g. Ch 3 Analysis Paragraph': '例如：第 3 章 分析段落', 'Class': '班级', 'Summatives and in-class assessments count toward the term grade in the Gradebook. Formative activities are feedback only.': '在成绩册里，总结性作业和课堂评估会计入学期成绩。形成性活动只用来反馈。',
    'The rubric is set the first time you open a download for it, with Rubric setup, and it’s remembered for this assignment.': '评分标准会在你第一次打开这份作业的下载时，用“Rubric setup”设置，并为这份作业保留。', 'The rubric is set the first time you open a download for it, with Rubric setup, and it’s remembered for this assignment. Copies in other classes get the same rubric.': '评分标准会在你第一次打开这份作业的下载时，用“Rubric setup”设置，并为这份作业保留。其他班级的副本也会使用同一份评分标准。',
