    'Kept in this browser.': '保存在这个浏览器中。', 'Coming from Google Classroom? Bring the class over…': '从 Google Classroom 过来吗？把班级带过来…', 'Where are the papers? You can also drop the ZIP or the folder straight onto this assignment’s card.': '学生作业在哪里？你也可以把 ZIP 或文件夹直接拖到这份作业的卡片上。',
