    'from': '从', 'These start as the published MYP boundaries. Change them if your school uses others.': '缺省是公布的 MYP 分界。若学校使用其他分界，请修改。', 'The app holds the names of the criteria and these boundaries, nothing else from the IB. Descriptors are yours to paste in.': '本应用程序只存放标准名称和这些分界，没有 IB 的其他内容。描述语请自行粘贴。',
    'The lowest percent for each grade.': '每个成绩的最低百分比。', 'These numbers are only somewhere to start, and are not any subject’s own. Type in the boundaries your subject and level use; they are different for each subject and can change with each exam session.': '这些数字只是起点，不属于任何科目。请输入你的科目和程度使用的分界；各科目不同，而且每次考试季都可能改变。',
    'Components': '组成部分', 'How much each type of work counts in this class.': '这个班级中每种作业类型的比重。', 'A component is a type of work, such as Paper 1 or the internal assessment. Add or rename types in the gradebook’s Term setup. These weights are for this class only: your other classes keep your usual ones.': '组成部分是一种作业类型，例如 Paper 1 或内部评估。在成绩册的“学期设置”中添加或重命名类型。这些比重只适用于这个班级，其他班级保留你平常的比重。',
    'Work is still marked in points or with a rubric. The weighted percent is turned into 1 to 7 with the boundaries.': '作业仍然用分数或评分标准评分。加权后的百分比会依分界换算成 1 到 7。', 'Email wording': '电子邮件内容', 'Every reminder is written from these words. Your mail app adds your signature as usual.': '每封提醒都由这段文本写成。你的邮件程序会照常加上签名。',
