    'Use the built-in wording': '使用内置文本', 'Wording': '措辞', 'A draft is built from these sentences. Write each one your way, one on a line. With several lines, students get different ones.': '草稿由这些句子组成。每句用你自己的方式写，一行一句。有好几行时，学生会拿到不同的句子。',
