    'Stays here when the class is shuffled': '全班随机换位时会留在这里', 'Empty desk': '空课桌', 'No desk. Click to put one here': '没有课桌。按一下可在这里放一张', 'Desk. Click to take it away': '课桌。按一下可拿掉', 'Each point adds one percentage point to the term grade. Leave a student blank for none. It doesn’t change any assignment’s score.': '每一分会让学期成绩增加一个百分点。不加分的学生请留白。不会改变任何作业的分数。',
